    <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;text-align:center;"><b>RUSH ENTERPRISES, INC. REPORTS SECOND QUARTER 2026 RESULTS,</b>
      <br><b>ANNOUNCES THREE-FOR-TWO STOCK SPLIT AND $0.14 PER SHARE DIVIDEND (POST-STOCK SPLIT)</b>
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&nbsp;</p>
